tenemos...
-Mm-mm, mm-mm.

64
00:04:04,661 --> 00:04:05,829
A la 1:00 no.
Cancélala.

65
00:04:05,829 --> 00:04:07,622
(suena música densa)

66
00:04:07,664 --> 00:04:09,374
(cámara lenta)

67
00:04:24,055 --> 00:04:25,849
El maldito Mike Dean.

68
00:04:25,890 --> 00:04:27,392
